@page "/"

<PageTitle>Scheduler</PageTitle>

<h1>Scheduler</h1>

<p>
    Find a meeting time across people and organizations without sharing calendars. The organizer proposes
    times that work for them; everyone else votes <em>preferred</em>, <em>yes</em>, <em>if necessary</em> or <em>no</em>.
</p>

<p>
    Answer from the voting link in your invitation email, or let your AI agent do it. Connected to Scheduler and to
    your calendar, an agent can check every proposed time for you, vote, and organize meetings of its own.
</p>

<p><a class="button" href="/agents">Use Scheduler with your agent</a></p>
